cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "closed-loop-default-detection"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic synthetic harness that stress-tests probability-of-default
  (PD) modeling under selective labels, applies correction levers (IPW reweight,
  disjoint-cohort retrain, exploration), and reports the model's honest operating
  frontier on the declined subpopulation real data cannot observe.
type: software
